('advanced-native-1094', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1094-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["One label covered two different statuses, so the team separated them before confirming the booking."],"options":["The meeting settled the booking by choosing whichever date was mentioned first.","One label covered two different statuses, so the team separated them before confirming the booking.","The venue had already cancelled both dates, leaving no booking to clarify.","The team used separate labels from the start and discussed only one confirmed date."]},"advanced-native-1094-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The same wording was being used for a proposal and a confirmed arrangement.","Using “opening day” for both muddied the waters about what had actually been agreed.","We needed to distinguish an idea from a final booking before asking the venue.","People could not tell which date still needed confirmation."],"options":["The same wording was being used for a proposal and a confirmed arrangement.","Using “opening day” for both muddied the waters about what had actually been agreed.","We needed to distinguish an idea from a final booking before asking the venue.","People could not tell which date still needed confirmation."]},"advanced-native-1094-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Combining those percentages without the different definitions would muddy the waters about participation."],"options":["The percentages already measure the same action, so no explanation of participation is needed.","Combining those percentages without the different definitions would muddy the waters about participation.","Different definitions prove that both sets of readers deliberately gave false answers."]},"advanced-native-1094-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker must be deliberately lying."],"options":["Clarifying terms or evidence may reduce the confusion.","The statement makes an issue harder to understand clearly.","The speaker must be deliberately lying."]},"advanced-native-1094-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The shared label muddied the waters, but the records distinguish a proposal from a confirmed date; let us label them accurately before checking the final booking."],"options":["We should describe the disagreement as dishonesty without comparing the booking messages.","The shared label muddied the waters, but the records distinguish a proposal from a confirmed date; let us label them accurately before checking the final booking.","Let us use the earlier date without saying whether it was proposed or confirmed."]},"advanced-native-1094-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The unverified claim about the coordinator is muddying the waters in our venue discussion. Let us compare the room facts we have and put the staffing question on a separate list to check.","Bringing the rumour into this choice could muddy the waters, since we do not know whether it is true or relevant to the booking. We should keep the verified venue concerns and ask separately what needs confirming about staffing."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1095', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1095-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The group began with one checked box while keeping a clear list of the remaining work."],"options":["The families refused to discuss any dates, so the group abandoned the archive before opening a box.","A fixed completion date was announced before the group counted the remaining boxes.","The group began with one checked box while keeping a clear list of the remaining work.","The first display proves that the dates in every box have already been confirmed."]},"advanced-native-1095-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It will be a long haul, so one box gives us a manageable first stage while we track the rest.","The full collection needs more checking than a single display can complete.","A smaller first stage lets us show checked material without pretending the remaining boxes are ready.","Each box needs date checks with different families."],"options":["It will be a long haul, so one box gives us a manageable first stage while we track the rest.","The full collection needs more checking than a single display can complete.","A smaller first stage lets us show checked material without pretending the remaining boxes are ready.","Each box needs date checks with different families."]},"advanced-native-1095-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Learning the full set will be a long haul, with short practice stages and adjustments along the way."],"options":["Calling it a long haul means the teacher has decided that practice cannot lead to improvement.","Learning the full set will be a long haul, with short practice stages and adjustments along the way.","The teacher expects the learner to play the whole set correctly after the first short session."]},"advanced-native-1095-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is certain to be impossible to improve or complete."],"options":["Stages and support may matter for keeping the work sustainable.","It is expected to require sustained time and effort.","It is certain to be impossible to improve or complete."]},"advanced-native-1095-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is a long haul, but a clearly labelled first stage can share checked material while keeping the unfinished work visible."],"options":["Since the first box is ready, the remaining boxes should also be ready for display without further checking.","We should postpone even the checked box until every family has answered every question about the remaining collection.","It is a long haul, but a clearly labelled first stage can share checked material while keeping the unfinished work visible."]},"advanced-native-1095-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["This could be a long haul, especially with the dialect checks, so what pace would you feel able to keep? We could plan fewer pages, rest days and another reader to share the checking.","Translating and checking the stories may be a long haul, and you do not have to manage it alone every evening. Could we discuss a smaller weekly target and someone to help with the dialect?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1096', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1096-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Some panels were completed, but drying time and the ladder’s return interrupted the work."],"options":["The team painted continuously until every panel was complete in one session.","No painting had begun because the team had not yet chosen a wall.","The finished panels were removed because the next session was already cancelled permanently.","Some panels were completed, but drying time and the ladder’s return interrupted the work."]},"advanced-native-1096-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The activity came in separate periods rather than one continuous stretch.","We had visible progress, followed by practical interruptions that needed another session.","We completed panels between pauses for drying and equipment availability.","It advanced in fits and starts because the wall and ladder were not ready throughout the session."],"options":["The activity came in separate periods rather than one continuous stretch.","We had visible progress, followed by practical interruptions that needed another session.","We completed panels between pauses for drying and equipment availability.","It advanced in fits and starts because the wall and ladder were not ready throughout the session."]},"advanced-native-1096-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She practised in fits and starts around her shifts, with several sessions separated by breaks."],"options":["She practised in fits and starts around her shifts, with several sessions separated by breaks.","She practised for the same uninterrupted period on every day of the week.","The gaps establish that she learned nothing during the sessions she completed."]},"advanced-native-1096-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["There has been no progress at any stage."],"options":["There has been no progress at any stage.","The causes of the pauses need separate contextual evidence.","Its activity or progress is intermittent."]},"advanced-native-1096-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We worked in fits and starts, but the finished panels show progress; let us record both the work and the interruptions."],"options":["We worked in fits and starts, but the finished panels show progress; let us record both the work and the interruptions.","The two finished panels show that the painting must have continued without any breaks.","The completed panels must belong to an earlier session, not to this interrupted work."]},"advanced-native-1096-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The letter takes shape in fits and starts as she keeps listening for footsteps. Could you make the breaks clear beside the sentences she actually writes, so readers can feel that interrupted rhythm?","She is writing in fits and starts, and the pauses can convey her anxiety. I would distinguish those pauses from the words on the page without deciding for the reader whether the whole letter remains unfinished."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1097', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1097-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["It was offered without an application, but the group still had to assess preparation time."],"options":["It was offered without an application, but the group still had to assess preparation time.","The group won the room after a planned application and a judged selection process.","The organiser confirmed that all the work was already installed and ready for visitors.","The room was offered only after the group paid for a larger venue elsewhere."]},"advanced-native-1097-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["An unexpected withdrawal opened a place that the organiser offered directly to us.","The organiser offered it after another group withdrew, without asking us to apply.","The opportunity fell into our lap rather than coming through an application process.","We had not sought that room when it became available."],"options":["An unexpected withdrawal opened a place that the organiser offered directly to us.","The organiser offered it after another group withdrew, without asking us to apply.","The opportunity fell into our lap rather than coming through an application process.","We had not sought that room when it became available."]},"advanced-native-1097-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The job fell into my lap without my seeking it."],"options":["The offer followed preparation and revisions rather than an unrequested invitation.","The job fell into my lap without my seeking it.","I obtained the job after several weeks of applications and discussion."]},"advanced-native-1097-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Making use of it will require no preparation or responsibility."],"options":["Making use of it will require no preparation or responsibility.","The surrounding account may explain the unexpected offer.","It came without the usual seeking or effort to obtain it."]},"advanced-native-1097-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The opportunity fell into our lap, but let us check the work and installation time before accepting the Friday opening."],"options":["The offer probably includes extra preparation time after Friday, so we need not check whether the work can be ready by then.","The opportunity fell into our lap, but let us check the work and installation time before accepting the Friday opening.","An unexpected offer means the organiser has already taken over our preparation work."]},"advanced-native-1097-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["A ready-made set of interviews will not fall into our lap while we wait for someone else to plan them. Could we invite two willing residents to discuss one topic, making it clear that they can decline?","The contacts and questions are unlikely to fall into our lap, so let us begin with a small invitation rather than another week of waiting. We can ask two residents what they would be comfortable discussing without promising a particular answer."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1098', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1098-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker cared about a format they helped shape and wanted participants’ feedback after the trial."],"options":["The speaker left the group before the new format was planned and did not care about the result.","The speaker cared about a format they helped shape and wanted participants’ feedback after the trial.","The speaker’s only connection was paying a fee for the room, without helping shape participation.","The trial confirmed that no participant wanted any changes, so feedback was cancelled."]},"advanced-native-1098-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I had helped shape their ways to join and cared about whether those worked.","I was invested in the format’s success, so their experience mattered more than defending my first version.","The trial was meant to make participation easier, and I wanted to know whether it did.","Their feedback could show what to change after the short first session."],"options":["I had helped shape their ways to join and cared about whether those worked.","I was invested in the format’s success, so their experience mattered more than defending my first version.","The trial was meant to make participation easier, and I wanted to know whether it did.","Their feedback could show what to change after the short first session."]},"advanced-native-1098-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["He is invested in his child’s learning while leaving the performance decision to the child."],"options":["Letting the child choose shows that he no longer cares about the learning experience.","He is invested in his child’s learning while leaving the performance decision to the child.","His main priority is choosing the child’s next performance, rather than whether the child enjoys learning."]},"advanced-native-1098-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["They have necessarily paid money and gained authority over others’ choices."],"options":["They care personally about how it develops.","They have necessarily paid money and gained authority over others’ choices.","The outcome may matter to them beyond a detached observation."]},"advanced-native-1098-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Being invested in the format means I care whether it works for them; I want their feedback before deciding what to keep."],"options":["Being invested in the format means I care whether it works for them; I want their feedback before deciding what to keep.","I should keep the first version unchanged so that listening to feedback cannot weaken my involvement.","I could ask only the members who liked my original format and use their comments to decide what stays."]},"advanced-native-1098-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I became invested in her story when I saw her keep the weekly promise to her neighbour. I want to know whether she can make the final visit, even though I do not agree with every choice she makes.","I am invested in this character’s journey because her visits show a care I did not notice in her first conversations. That concern for what happens next does not mean I already know the ending or approve of all her actions."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1099', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1099-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The group used existing food and shared surplus while tracking waste without claiming zero impact."],"options":["The weekly note had already measured the complete impact of producing and transporting every meal.","The group’s stated aim was to reduce body weight rather than resource use.","The group used existing food and shared surplus while tracking waste without claiming zero impact.","The group replaced all cupboard food before planning meals and stopped recording what was unused."]},"advanced-native-1099-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["We wanted to live a little more lightly by reducing avoidable food waste.","Planning around existing supplies gave us a practical first change to try.","It helped us notice what we could use or share before buying more.","We wanted to use what we had before letting it go unused."],"options":["We wanted to live a little more lightly by reducing avoidable food waste.","Planning around existing supplies gave us a practical first change to try.","It helped us notice what we could use or share before buying more.","We wanted to use what we had before letting it go unused."]},"advanced-native-1099-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["They are trying to live more lightly by sharing suitable tools, while recognising that some needs remain individual."],"options":["They have finished sharing the tools and measured the total impact before checking which items are suitable to lend.","They are trying to live more lightly by sharing suitable tools, while recognising that some needs remain individual.","They have already agreed that every tool on the proposed list will be shared, including the ones they said should stay personal."]},"advanced-native-1099-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["We have already proved that our lives have no environmental impact."],"options":["Specific actions and practical limits should explain the intention.","We intend to reduce some resource use or environmental pressure.","We have already proved that our lives have no environmental impact."]},"advanced-native-1099-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["We are trying to live more lightly, but the note shows only our food waste; let us describe that change without claiming a complete impact measurement."],"options":["We are trying to live more lightly, but the note shows only our food waste; let us describe that change without claiming a complete impact measurement.","A lower waste count is enough to label every part of our lifestyle impact-free.","Because the note is not a full measurement, we should stop recording whether the food is used."]},"advanced-native-1099-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We invite you to explore ways to live a little more lightly, such as borrowing a display board or reusing a sign. Choose what works for you, and use the supplies here if bringing your own container is not practical.","Come and try a small way to live more lightly by sharing display materials or bringing a container if you can. These are optional choices, not a test of your values or a claim that the whole exhibition has no impact."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1100', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1100-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["More groups gained access to supported recording, while evening availability remained limited."],"options":["The waiting list was removed because the studio offered unlimited evening sessions.","More groups gained access to supported recording, while evening availability remained limited.","Every team had already completed a broadcast before the studio opened.","The studio changed only the colour of a room that the same groups used in the same way."]},"advanced-native-1100-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Groups unable to hire their own rooms could now book supported recording time.","It changed the landscape by opening practical recording access to more local groups.","The shared arrangement altered who could make a programme, not only how an existing room looked.","The new sessions created an option that separate room hire had kept beyond some groups’ resources."],"options":["Groups unable to hire their own rooms could now book supported recording time.","It changed the landscape by opening practical recording access to more local groups.","The shared arrangement altered who could make a programme, not only how an existing room looked.","The new sessions created an option that separate room hire had kept beyond some groups’ resources."]},"advanced-native-1100-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The new heading colour changed the landscape of participation in the club."],"options":["The change affected the heading’s appearance but not the participation arrangements.","The stated features and rules remained the same after the colour change.","The new heading colour changed the landscape of participation in the club."]},"advanced-native-1100-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["It necessarily benefited everyone equally and removed the remaining limits."],"options":["It altered important wider conditions in that field.","It necessarily benefited everyone equally and removed the remaining limits.","The claim needs an explanation of what changed and for whom."]},"advanced-native-1100-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The studio changed the landscape for access, but the evening queue still matters; let us report the new opportunities and the remaining limit together."],"options":["A wider opportunity means the waiting list no longer tells us anything relevant.","Because some teams still wait, the new access for other groups should not be mentioned.","The studio changed the landscape for access, but the evening queue still matters; let us report the new opportunities and the remaining limit together."]},"advanced-native-1100-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The bridge changed the landscape of daily life on both banks, bringing trade, family visits and student projects into closer contact. Its night closure and the journeys from distant homes still shaped who could use those opportunities.","By linking the two banks on foot, the bridge changed the landscape for work and relationships rather than simply adding a new outline to the river. The change was substantial, but access still depended on distance and opening hours."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
