essment of the real exhibition structure."],"options":["Because the real structure was not tested, there is no point recording the model’s failure.","The model shelf gave way in this trial; let us report that observation without treating it as an assessment of the real exhibition structure.","We can apply the model result directly to the real structure without checking how the two differ."]},"advanced-native-1102-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I heard a crack behind me and turned to see part of the bridge give way. We were already on the far bank, but I could not tell what had caused the failure.","The sound made me turn just as a section of the bridge gave way behind us. From the far bank I could see the fallen boards, not why they had failed."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
