g source.","It can provide no temporary benefit at all."]},"advanced-native-1104-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Another message alone would treat the symptom rather than the cause, but we can send today’s correction while removing the old schedules."],"options":["Let us wait for the full redesign before telling today’s helpers that the room has changed.","We can send the correction and leave the old schedules in place as the regular reference.","Another message alone would treat the symptom rather than the cause, but we can send today’s correction while removing the old schedules."]},"advanced-native-1104-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Another gift would treat the symptom rather than the cause if he still avoids the complaint about making decisions for his father. I would let the next scene begin with him asking what his father wants to choose for himself.","He is treating the symptom rather than the cause when presents replace a conversation about his father’s choices. Could the next scene show him listening to that concern without assuming forgiveness has already followed?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1105', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1105-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Equal token cost was compared with reuse across three events, while setup time remained a drawback."],"options":["The posters could be renamed for all three events, while the letters were discarded after one.","The trial measured every production cost and found that the letters took no time to arrange.","Equal token cost was compared with reuse across three events, while setup time remained a drawback.","The letters were chosen only because they had the lowest initial price in the trial."]},"advanced-native-1105-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They gave us more bang for the buck by covering repeated uses rather than one fixed poster.","The comparison included how many events each set of signs could serve.","Their reuse made the equal purchase cost more useful for our particular programme.","We could change the names across three events for the same twenty-token cost."],"options":["They gave us more bang for the buck by covering repeated uses rather than one fixed poster.","The comparison included how many events each set of signs could serve.","Their reuse made the equal purchase cost more useful for our particular programme.","We could change the names across three events for the same twenty-token cost."]},"advanced-native-1105-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The extra practice may offer more bang for the buck if it meets the learners’ needs, but we should test that before deciding."],"options":["The workshop with the shorter list offers better value simply because there is less material to get through.","The extra practice may offer more bang for the buck if it meets the learners’ needs, but we should test that before deciding.","More listed activities prove the second workshop has already produced better learning."]},"advanced-native-1105-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The option must have the lowest purchase price regardless of its usefulness."],