('advanced-native-1106', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1106-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["A pause from the crowded journey’s demands, while her route home remained busy."],"options":["A new home outside the city that replaced her daily journey.","Another screen-based task she had to finish before leaving.","An account of what every courtyard visitor felt, gathered through a survey.","A pause from the crowded journey’s demands, while her route home remained busy."]},"advanced-native-1106-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She can sit among the plants before returning to the busy route.","The courtyard offers a short change of pace, rather than another demand.","It gives her a quiet place without more announcements or screens asking for attention.","It feels like a refuge from urban life after the crowded journey."],"options":["She can sit among the plants before returning to the busy route.","The courtyard offers a short change of pace, rather than another demand.","It gives her a quiet place without more announcements or screens asking for attention.","It feels like a refuge from urban life after the crowded journey."]},"advanced-native-1106-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The park was a refuge from urban life for him during that noisy visit."],"options":["The park was a refuge from urban life for him during that noisy visit.","Being outside the city did not make this particular visit restful for him.","His account describes queues and amplified music rather than the relief he hoped for."]},"advanced-native-1106-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every visitor must find it restful and all urban problems have been solved."],"options":["Every visitor must find it restful and all urban problems have been solved.","Specific features can explain the person’s sense of respite.","That person experiences relief from some city-related pressure there."]},"advanced-native-1106-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The courtyard is a refuge from urban life for Mei, but let us ask Jun what kind of break he wants before arranging the visit."],"options":["We should choose the farthest place from the city, since distance matters more than whether Jun wants company.","The courtyard is a refuge from urban life for Mei, but let us ask Jun what kind of break he wants before arranging the visit.","Let us book a long visit for Jun on the strength of Mei’s recommendation and ask about his preferences afterwards."]},"advanced-native-1106-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["A quiet garden is a refuge from urban life for me, but I understand that you would rather talk over tea. Could we discuss what each of us needs and choose how to spend our two hours together?","We may not experience the same place as a refuge from urban life, so let us agree on a plan rather than assume we want the same break. I would like some quiet time, and I want to hear how much time you would like for a conversation."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1109', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1109-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The evening workshop lost regular attendance linked to the return journey, while the afternoon group stayed stable."],"options":["The evening workshop caused the timetable change by asking regulars to stop using the bus.","Only the afternoon group was affected, and every evening regular could still travel home.","The evening workshop lost regular attendance linked to the return journey, while the afternoon group stayed stable.","Both groups had already increased their attendance because the bus now ran later."]},"advanced-native-1109-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It took the hit from the changed return service, which made attendance impractical for some regulars.","The session ends after the last return bus, according to the regulars who stopped coming.","The transport change affected their ability to get home, rather than their stated interest in the activity.","Several said the new timetable left them without a bus home after the session."],"options":["It took the hit from the changed return service, which made attendance impractical for some regulars.","The session ends after the last return bus, according to the regulars who stopped coming.","The transport change affected their ability to get home, rather than their stated interest in the activity.","Several said the new timetable left them without a bus home after the session."]},"advanced-native-1109-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The picture detail took the hit when the file was reduced, while the sound remained clear."],"options":["The picture detail took the hit when the file was reduced, while the sound remained clear.","The sound alone became unclear, while all the written detail stayed easy to read.","The smaller file proves that no aspect of the demonstration changed."]},"advanced-native-1109-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The group must have caused the original problem."],"options":[