('advanced-native-1112', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1112-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Unowned, unlabelled abandoned files made the current script hard to identify."],"options":["Unowned, unlabelled abandoned files made the current script hard to identify.","Each draft had an assigned owner and a clear current-version label before upload.","The folder contained only the agreed final script, with no other files.","The helpers could easily identify the current script and had asked to keep the extra drafts for a display."]},"advanced-native-1112-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["A clear owner and label would give each new file a purpose in the shared space.","The abandoned drafts were making the current script hard to find.","The folder had become a dumping ground, with nobody responsible for many of the drafts.","We needed to distinguish work still in use from files that had been left behind."],"options":["A clear owner and label would give each new file a purpose in the shared space.","The abandoned drafts were making the current script hard to find.","The folder had become a dumping ground, with nobody responsible for many of the drafts.","We needed to distinguish work still in use from files that had been left behind."]},"advanced-native-1112-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The maintained store is a dumping ground simply because the boards are old."],"options":["Old materials can be stored responsibly rather than abandoned without care.","The maintained store is a dumping ground simply because the boards are old.","The labels and planned reuse show an agreed storage purpose."]},"advanced-native-1112-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Materials are accepted for a named use, labelled and maintained by an agreed team."],"options":["Unwanted items are left with no agreed keeper and obstruct the space’s purpose.","Materials are accepted for a named use, labelled and maintained by an agreed team.","People repeatedly leave unfinished work for othe