('advanced-native-1113', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1113-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The speaker raised a specific credit concern quietly, and the editor agreed to check it."],"options":["The speaker shouted until the editor confirmed the corrected page had already been printed.","The speaker stayed silent and gave no information about the photographer.","The editor asked the speaker only to make the voice louder for the back row.","The speaker raised a specific credit concern quietly, and the editor agreed to check it."]},"advanced-native-1113-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The original credit gave me specific evidence worth checking with her.","I did not want the attribution concern to go unmentioned during the final check.","The photographer’s name did not match the original credit line.","I wanted to speak up about the wrong credit before the page was printed."],"options":["The original credit gave me specific evidence worth checking with her.","I did not want the attribution concern to go unmentioned during the final check.","The photographer’s name did not match the original credit line.","I wanted to speak up about the wrong credit before the page was printed."]},"advanced-native-1113-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["He spoke up by raising an objection to the script."],"options":["He was asked to make the same words easier for the back row to hear.","The request concerned volume, not whether he should express a new opinion.","He spoke up by raising an objection to the script."]},"advanced-native-1113-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["They necessarily raised their voice so that the whole room could hear."],"options":["They necessarily raised their voice so that the whole room could hear.","The context can identify the issue and the way they raised it.","They expressed the concern rather than kept it silent."]},"advanced-native-1113-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I spoke up about the credit even though I spoke quietly; raising