('advanced-native-1118', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1118-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The skills supported a later journey without making supported practice unnecessary."],"options":["The helper answered the route questions without allowing learners to practise asking them.","The learners no longer needed support for the full journey once they could ask a clear question.","The skills supported a later journey without making supported practice unnecessary.","The learners practised the full route before learning how to ask about changing buses."]},"advanced-native-1118-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Clear questions are building blocks for asking for help during the journey.","The smaller skill had a practical use in the larger visit we were preparing.","We wanted learners to recognise one way to get information before practising the whole route.","The learners would need to ask where to change buses."],"options":["Clear questions are building blocks for asking for help during the journey.","The smaller skill had a practical use in the larger visit we were preparing.","We wanted learners to recognise one way to get information before practising the whole route.","The learners would need to ask where to change buses."]},"advanced-native-1118-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Sequencing and retelling are building blocks for the later comparison, not a substitute for practising it."],"options":["Sequencing and retelling are building blocks for the later comparison, not a substitute for practising it.","Retelling one story shows that the students have already compared the narrators’ different views.","They have been asked only to retell the plot again, not to compare the narrators."]},"advanced-native-1118-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The skills alone guarantee success in every later situation."],"options":["The skills can support further learning or everyday activity.","The skills alone guarantee success in every later situation.","Example