('advanced-native-1120', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1120-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Members practised practical communication and responsibility through actual club situations."],"options":["The group practised only sewing technique, while the leader handled the deadlines and disagreements.","A missed handover ended the collaboration before any misunderstanding was discussed.","These tasks were agreed for next term but had not yet been tried in the club.","Members practised practical communication and responsibility through actual club situations."]},"advanced-native-1120-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["A missed handover gives them a real reason to discuss and repair a misunderstanding.","The activity creates chances to use communication skills rather than only hear advice about them.","Members practise asking for help and agreeing deadlines together.","It can be a training ground for life through those shared responsibilities."],"options":["A missed handover gives them a real reason to discuss and repair a misunderstanding.","The activity creates chances to use communication skills rather than only hear advice about them.","Members practise asking for help and agreeing deadlines together.","It can be a training ground for life through those shared responsibilities."]},"advanced-native-1120-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["This account does not yet show the school acting as a training ground for life through cooperative practice."],"options":["This account does not yet show the school acting as a training ground for life through cooperative practice.","The students shared the task roles themselves before the teacher finished the work.","The school has already tested how students use these skills outside the classroom."]},"advanced-native-1120-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The members already know how to handle the next unfamiliar disagreement without support."],"options":["The claim needs examples of what people actually practise th