('advanced-native-1121', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1121-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The group resumed constructive work and applied again, with acceptance still unknown."],"options":["The group resumed constructive work and applied again, with acceptance still unknown.","The second exhibition had already accepted the proposal before the group met again.","The group stopped work after the rejection and decided not to meet again.","They reused the first proposal without revising how the project was explained."]},"advanced-native-1121-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The new submission was a concrete step after the earlier disappointment.","They met again and prepared a clearer proposal for another exhibition.","They bounced back enough to apply again instead of leaving the work abandoned.","Their willingness to work together returned, even though the next result was still uncertain."],"options":["The new submission was a concrete step after the earlier disappointment.","They met again and prepared a clearer proposal for another exhibition.","They bounced back enough to apply again instead of leaving the work abandoned.","Their willingness to work together returned, even though the next result was still uncertain."]},"advanced-native-1121-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Orders have bounced back to their earlier level, without evidence that they have surpassed it."],"options":["Orders have now risen above their earlier level.","Orders have bounced back to their earlier level, without evidence that they have surpassed it.","Orders are still falling at the same rate as the first week."]},"advanced-native-1121-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["They must already be stronger than before and certain to succeed next time."],"options":["They must already be stronger than before and certain to succeed next time.","The context should identify the setback and the signs of recovery.","Some form of recovery after a setback is taking place."]},"advanced-