('advanced-native-1127', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1127-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Completing the story was rewarding in itself, and the public reading added another pleasure."],"options":["The story remained unfinished, and the reading replaced the need to finish it.","The group valued the public reading but found no pleasure in having written together.","Completing the story was rewarding in itself, and the public reading added another pleasure.","The group began writing only after the village evening had promised to read the story."]},"advanced-native-1127-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It was the icing on the cake because the writing had already been worthwhile to us.","Being heard by others added to something we already valued.","We did not need the invitation to make our shared writing feel rewarding.","We had already enjoyed completing the story together."],"options":["It was the icing on the cake because the writing had already been worthwhile to us.","Being heard by others added to something we already valued.","We did not need the invitation to make our shared writing feel rewarding.","We had already enjoyed completing the story together."]},"advanced-native-1127-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The illustration card was the icing on the cake after an exhibition I had already enjoyed."],"options":["Receiving the card was the condition on which I had agreed to attend.","The illustration card was the icing on the cake after an exhibition I had already enjoyed.","The card was the only worthwhile part of a visit I otherwise disliked."]},"advanced-native-1127-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The supposed extra is the only thing that gives an otherwise unwanted experience any value."],"options":["The main achievement still matters without the extra benefit.","A welcome extra improves an already satisfying experience.","The supposed extra is the only thing that gives an otherwise unwanted experience any value."]},"advanced-native-