('advanced-native-1133', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1133-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The new ending received praise, while the rest of the manuscript still awaited discussion."],"options":["Mira had already discussed the whole manuscript before receiving the comment on the ending.","The new ending received praise, while the rest of the manuscript still awaited discussion.","The editor approved the entire manuscript and cancelled the next meeting.","The message criticised the added link and asked Mira to remove it before meeting."]},"advanced-native-1133-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The editor noticed and praised the link she had added to the ending.","It was a pat on the back for a specific improvement she had made.","Her work on making the ending clearer had been recognised.","The comment showed that the new link was working for that reader."],"options":["The editor noticed and praised the link she had added to the ending.","It was a pat on the back for a specific improvement she had made.","Her work on making the ending clearer had been recognised.","The comment showed that the new link was working for that reader."]},"advanced-native-1133-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["This is a correction with a next step, rather than a pat on the back."],"options":["This is a correction with a next step, rather than a pat on the back.","The comment praises how well the baton change went this time.","The coach has approved the whole race plan without asking for a change."]},"advanced-native-1133-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["A complete assessment has approved every part of the person’s work."],"options":["A complete assessment has approved every part of the person’s work.","The context can identify what the praise refers to.","Someone expressed approval of an action or achievement."]},"advanced-native-1133-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It is a pat on the back for the ending, not approval of the whole manuscript; keep the meeting for th