('advanced-native-1135', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1135-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Time and mentoring support had begun, while independent skill use was still to be evaluated."],"options":["The workshop had only written a slogan, with no learning sessions yet started.","The evaluation had already established that each newcomer could work independently.","Newcomers were asked to learn entirely outside paid time without a partner.","Time and mentoring support had begun, while independent skill use was still to be evaluated."]},"advanced-native-1135-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Participants can practise with support instead of being expected to arrive with every skill.","The arrangement commits resources to learning before judging independent performance.","Newcomers have learning time and access to experienced makers.","It is investing in people through practical time and mentoring, not only announcing an aim."],"options":["Participants can practise with support instead of being expected to arrive with every skill.","The arrangement commits resources to learning before judging independent performance.","Newcomers have learning time and access to experienced makers.","It is investing in people through practical time and mentoring, not only announcing an aim."]},"advanced-native-1135-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The club plans to invest in people through mentoring, but the sessions have not yet been arranged."],"options":["The club has already checked which mentoring skills each member can use alone.","The club plans to invest in people through mentoring, but the sessions have not yet been arranged.","Approving the budget confirms that members have completed the mentoring programme."]},"advanced-native-1135-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["The support has necessarily produced an immediate financial return."],"options":["The context should identify who receives which resources.","Resources are devoted to people’s development or supp