('advanced-native-1143', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1143-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["She was rebuilding valued routines while some practical moving tasks remained."],"options":["She was rebuilding valued routines while some practical moving tasks remained.","All unpacking had finished before she could begin either arrangement.","She had abandoned contact with her sister to concentrate entirely on unpacking.","A regular library visit was someone else’s imposed plan, which she said she did not value."]},"advanced-native-1143-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She could begin recovering something meaningful while the practical work continued.","They restored activities and contact that she personally valued.","Getting life back on track meant rebuilding those familiar parts, not waiting until every box was empty.","The arrangements gave her week some shape after the disruption of moving."],"options":["She could begin recovering something meaningful while the practical work continued.","They restored activities and contact that she personally valued.","Getting life back on track meant rebuilding those familiar parts, not waiting until every box was empty.","The arrangements gave her week some shape after the disruption of moving."]},"advanced-native-1143-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Getting his life back on track can include that valued connection, while the work decision remains open."],"options":["Getting his life back on track can include that valued connection, while the work decision remains open.","The weekly walk confirms that he has already accepted a full-time job.","Until he chooses full-time work, no part of his routine can have become more stable."]},"advanced-native-1143-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["They must restore every detail of the old routine, regardless of what they now want."],"options":["The context should explain which direction or routine matters to that person.","Someone is moving towards a more stable or inten